        "approval_date": "2017-04-07",
        "description": {
          "text": "Expanded sofosbuvir plus ribavirin to pediatric patients 12-17 years or \u226535 kg with chronic HCV genotype 2 or 3 without cirrhosis or with compensated cirrhosis",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval supplemental new drug application proposes to expand the patient population for sofosbuvir in combination with ribavirin to include the treatment of pediatric patients 12 to 17 years of age or weighing at least 35 kg with chronic hepatitis C virus genotype 2 or 3 infection without cirrhosis or with compensated cirrhosis based upon the data from Trial GS-US-334-1112.",
              "doc_id": "85da2ea0-921f-58bf-8e20-dc535ff52708",
              "line": 6
            }
